WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.411 --> 00:00:01.645
- Good morning Believe Nation.

00:00:01.645 --> 00:00:04.809
Today's message is drive emotion.

00:00:04.809 --> 00:00:06.809
Over to you, ASAP Rocky.

00:00:08.446 --> 00:00:11.745
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:14.459
♫ Espresso keep me going

00:00:14.459 --> 00:00:18.303
♫ I wake up every morning

00:00:18.303 --> 00:00:19.972
- Yeah I'm 26.

00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:24.069
I look at life through a
different point of view

00:00:24.069 --> 00:00:27.016
than your typical rappers.

00:00:27.016 --> 00:00:31.183
For me life is all about
vibrations and chemistry.

00:00:32.912 --> 00:00:35.460
It's all about positive
vibes and negative vibes.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:39.794
I think energy is
stronger than intentions.

00:00:39.794 --> 00:00:43.711
I wanted to manifest
those vibes into my music.

00:00:45.865 --> 00:00:48.324
I wanted you people to
hear my music and feel

00:00:48.324 --> 00:00:52.157
a certain way, a sensation,
even if you wanted

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:58.321
to turn that shit right
the... I'm fine with that.

00:00:58.321 --> 00:01:00.428
I want you to feel something (laughs).

00:01:00.428 --> 00:01:02.361
I don't want it to feel bland and for you

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:03.990
to just be like "oh yeah he did his..."

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:06.435
no. I want to drive emotion.

00:01:06.435 --> 00:01:08.422
- Your advantage as an
entrepreneur is your emotion.

00:01:08.422 --> 00:01:12.298
Your ability to make
people feel the passion

00:01:12.298 --> 00:01:14.740
for what you're doing in your company

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.366
to transfer it from you to somebody else.

00:01:17.366 --> 00:01:20.034
That's how you are going
to stand out because

00:01:20.034 --> 00:01:22.245
most companies don't do that

00:01:22.245 --> 00:01:23.761
and most companies are boring.

00:01:23.761 --> 00:01:25.682
What a lot of entrepreneurs
do is they look up

00:01:25.682 --> 00:01:27.986
to these giant corporations
that you're competing

00:01:27.986 --> 00:01:30.039
against and feel like you
need to be more professional

00:01:30.039 --> 00:01:32.588
so you have a standard
boring professional-looking

00:01:32.588 --> 00:01:35.443
website but understand you're always going

00:01:35.443 --> 00:01:37.888
to lose to the bigger
company if you're trying to

00:01:37.888 --> 00:01:42.114
keep like them because they
have a name people recognize.

00:01:42.114 --> 00:01:43.675
They have a track record of success.

00:01:43.675 --> 00:01:44.906
They've won a ton of awards.

00:01:44.906 --> 00:01:46.555
They have referrals and recommendations.

00:01:46.555 --> 00:01:48.497
They've been around,
so why would I ever buy

00:01:48.497 --> 00:01:50.677
from you instead of buying
from the big company

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:53.951
unless you have a lower price and that is

00:01:53.951 --> 00:01:57.251
the worst business model to
be in as an entrepreneur.

00:01:57.251 --> 00:02:00.216
You do not want to be in
the low price business.

00:02:00.216 --> 00:02:02.357
It's going to be a race
to the bottom because

00:02:02.357 --> 00:02:04.386
there's always going to
be somebody who's going to

00:02:04.386 --> 00:02:06.228
undercut your price and
as long as that person

00:02:06.228 --> 00:02:07.337
comes in you're out of of business.

00:02:07.337 --> 00:02:08.532
Your customers will leave
you because they only

00:02:08.532 --> 00:02:10.263
were with you because of the price.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:12.207
So the way to stand out, the way to win

00:02:12.207 --> 00:02:14.213
as the little guy going
against the big guy

00:02:14.213 --> 00:02:18.307
is your story, your
ability to convey emotion.

00:02:18.307 --> 00:02:21.016
Let me see your passion
for what you're doing

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:23.543
because if i see that you're passionate

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:26.225
about your work then I'm
going to get a better result.

00:02:26.225 --> 00:02:28.513
I feel like this person really cares about

00:02:28.513 --> 00:02:32.358
performing for me, giving
me a great experience

00:02:32.358 --> 00:02:35.022
whereas some giant
corporation doesn't care.

00:02:35.022 --> 00:02:37.496
I remember I had a caller
call into my radio show

00:02:37.496 --> 00:02:40.795
and they were in the
landscaping business and they

00:02:40.795 --> 00:02:43.136
were frustrated that
they were losing business

00:02:43.136 --> 00:02:46.176
to university kids and
high school kids who were

00:02:46.176 --> 00:02:49.752
charging minimum wage to
do landscaping services

00:02:49.752 --> 00:02:52.030
and he was having a hard time standing out

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:54.723
because he was three
or four times the cost.

00:02:54.723 --> 00:02:56.570
I said why did you start this business.

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.733
He said "this is really important to me.

00:02:58.733 --> 00:03:03.170
When I grew up I was
always outside with my mom

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:07.337
and she was teaching me about
how to take care of a lawn,

00:03:08.654 --> 00:03:12.821
of the outdoors," and
here's the line that got me.

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.569
"every time I go to a customer's house,

00:03:16.569 --> 00:03:19.053
I treat it like it was my mom's."

00:03:19.053 --> 00:03:21.093
now I feel something towards this person.

00:03:21.093 --> 00:03:23.136
Now I have a reason to buy.

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:24.965
That needs to be everywhere.

00:03:24.965 --> 00:03:26.716
When I visit that person's website,

00:03:26.716 --> 00:03:28.581
I need to see that message.

00:03:28.581 --> 00:03:32.460
I started this business as a
tribute to my mom and here's

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.958
what we did growing up
and every time I come to

00:03:34.958 --> 00:03:38.542
your home I treat it like it's my mom's.

00:03:38.542 --> 00:03:40.706
Do I get that same vibe if I'm going with

00:03:40.706 --> 00:03:42.784
a college university student?

00:03:42.784 --> 00:03:44.520
Do I get that same vibe if I'm hiring

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:47.687
some big company that has a huge crew?

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.005
This is why I'm going to pick you, because

00:03:52.005 --> 00:03:54.617
of your story and your ability to convey

00:03:54.617 --> 00:03:56.671
that emotion to me and I'm
willing to pay more for that.

00:03:56.671 --> 00:04:00.131
I'll pay three times
what you'll pay a college

00:04:00.131 --> 00:04:02.871
student to do it because I feel like

00:04:02.871 --> 00:04:05.425
you're going to do a
better job and no matter

00:04:05.425 --> 00:04:07.094
what you write on your website.

00:04:07.094 --> 00:04:09.331
You can write we do the
best job in the industry.

00:04:09.331 --> 00:04:12.893
Everybody's putting that on their website.

00:04:12.893 --> 00:04:16.234
It means nothing but
that story is something

00:04:16.234 --> 00:04:18.401
that only you can put out.

00:04:20.984 --> 00:04:22.641
You better have a good story
if you're starting this

00:04:22.641 --> 00:04:24.928
business and you don't
have a deep passion.

00:04:24.928 --> 00:04:27.276
Forget about it, go do something else.

00:04:27.276 --> 00:04:30.900
You have that deep passion
then let me feel it.

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:33.062
Share it with me. Tell me.

00:04:33.062 --> 00:04:35.128
Put it in your content.

00:04:35.128 --> 00:04:37.651
Have a video if you're
comfortable to do it

00:04:37.651 --> 00:04:40.114
but worst case at least have a picture

00:04:40.114 --> 00:04:43.228
and don't worry about it
being super professional

00:04:43.228 --> 00:04:44.952
because you're going to lose.

00:04:44.952 --> 00:04:47.670
When you can drive emotion and connect

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:51.512
to your customer that's
when you start to win.

00:04:51.512 --> 00:04:53.239
So the question today, I want you to get

00:04:53.239 --> 00:04:54.884
a little bit of practice.

00:04:54.884 --> 00:04:57.895
I want you to tell me why this
business is important to you.

00:04:57.895 --> 00:04:59.687
Why did you start this company?

00:04:59.687 --> 00:05:02.065
Why are you so passionate
about what you want to do?

00:05:02.065 --> 00:05:03.546
Why?

00:05:03.546 --> 00:05:05.040
Practice right now, this is your chance

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.179
to practice conveying some emotion to me

00:05:07.179 --> 00:05:08.779
and the rest of Believe Nation.

00:05:08.779 --> 00:05:10.118
Leave it in the comments below

00:05:10.118 --> 00:05:11.624
and we'll join in the discussion.

00:05:11.624 --> 00:05:13.211
Finally I want to give a quick shout-out

00:05:13.211 --> 00:05:14.988
to Himanshu Premi, Himanshu thank you

00:05:14.988 --> 00:05:16.305
so for picking up a copy of my book,

00:05:16.305 --> 00:05:18.525
Your One Word, and
sharing that YouTube video

00:05:18.525 --> 00:05:19.954
about it as well.

00:05:19.954 --> 00:05:21.547
I really appreciate the support and hope

00:05:21.547 --> 00:05:22.893
you are enjoying the book.

00:05:22.893 --> 00:05:24.412
Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:05:24.412 --> 00:05:26.296
I believe in you and
I hope you continue to

00:05:26.296 --> 00:05:29.320
believe in yourself and
whatever your one word is.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.045
I'll see you again tomorrow morning

00:05:31.045 --> 00:05:33.432
for another shot of Ent Spresso.

